DESCRIPTION:26th Annual Carolina Cup\, hosted by South Carolina United FC. Fri Oct 2 -
  Sun Oct 4\, 2026. Our four teams play 12 group games across Ballentine Pa
 rk Complex (U9B Premier)\, Polo Road Park (U10B Premier and Blue) and Dutc
 h Fork High School (U9B Blue). Drive from Savannah is about 169 miles / 3h
  15min. Online check-in only - no on-site check-in. Companion app: https:/
 /rrouleau-x.github.io/carolina-cup-guide/app/
URL:https://rrouleau-x.github.io/carolina-cup-guide/app/
